  message: "PR #2354 (stable-id v19, 2026-11-23/24), locals agent: reconfirmed on the PR's base arm that C# local functions emit no symbol (locals sweep fixture ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v19_11232026/locals/fixtures/sweep_langs/csharp/A.cs: `void H() {}` local to two constructors, two F overloads and three property accessors: none emitted; base_sweep.txt). As a consequence the PR's WI-finam locals scoping (Kotlin, Python, Scala, Dart, PHP, JS/TS, C++) could not be applied to C#; when local functions are emitted, they will need the same callable label or they tie across overloads and accessors."  # 6633
